@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #555
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #888
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

title Sequence Diagram - Quy trình chuyển đổi ngôn ngữ (UC-C06)

actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "Web UI\n(LanguageSwitcher)" as UI
participant "LanguageContext\n(useLang)" as Context
participant "localStorage\n/ Cookie" as Storage
participant "i18next\n(i18n instance)" as i18n

Customer -> UI: Click chọn ngôn ngữ\n(VD: Tiếng Anh)
activate UI

UI -> Context: setLang('en')
activate Context

Context -> Storage: localStorage.setItem('phat-lang', 'en')
activate Storage
Storage --> Context: OK
deactivate Storage

Context -> Storage: document.cookie = "phat_lang=en"
activate Storage
Storage --> Context: OK
deactivate Storage

Context -> i18n: changeLanguage('en')
activate i18n

alt [Chưa tải file JSON ngôn ngữ (en.json)]
    i18n -> i18n: Lazy load /locales/en.json
end

i18n --> Context: Promise resolved (Tải xong)
deactivate i18n

Context -> Context: Cập nhật React state (lang = 'en')
Context --> UI: State updated
deactivate Context

UI -> UI: React Re-render toàn bộ component
UI --> Customer: Giao diện hiển thị ngôn ngữ mới (Tiếng Anh)
deactivate UI

@enduml
